fm1gm.sf2 is a reduced version of the Fluid (R3) General MIDI SoundFont, made by
tools/sf2_reduce.py from FluidR3_GM.sf2 (as packaged in Debian and Ubuntu as
fluid-soundfont-gm 3.1). It keeps, for each GM program, one velocity layer and a
few mono samples, at lower sample rates, each cut to its attack and a short
loop; and 47 notes of the standard drum kit.

Like the original, it is under the MIT License:

